### Pruebas manuales de la API (extensión "REST Client" de VS Code)
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@gw = gw-uci-demo-key

### RNF-03 · Salud del servicio
GET {{base}}/health

### RF-04 · Login con tarjeta RFID (médico)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/rfid
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rfid": "RFID-MED-001" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### RF-04 · Tarjeta no autorizada (debe responder 401)
POST {{base}}/auth/rfid
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rfid": "RFID-FALSA-999" }

### Pacientes con últimas lecturas
GET {{base}}/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### RF-02 · El gateway envía una lectura
POST {{base}}/gateway/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json
x-gateway-key: {{gw}}

{ "pacienteId": "P-001", "tipo": "FC", "valor": 141, "timestampSensor": "2026-11-18T10:00:00Z" }

### RF-01 · Valor límite inferior (44 BPM) -> alarma FC_BAJA
POST {{base}}/gateway/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json
x-gateway-key: {{gw}}

{ "pacienteId": "P-002", "tipo": "FC", "valor": 44 }

### RF-03 · Historial por tipo y rango
GET {{base}}/patients/P-001/vitals?tipo=FC&desde=2026-11-18T00:00:00Z&hasta=2026-11-19T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alarmas activas
GET {{base}}/alarms?estado=ACTIVA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### RF-07 · Confirmar lectura de una alarma (reemplaza el id)
POST {{base}}/alarms/AL-xxxxxxxx/ack
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Simulador · forzar escenario de anafilaxia en UCI-03
POST {{base}}/simulator/P-003/scenario
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "escenario": "ANAFILAXIA" }

### RF-08 · Incidentes detectados
GET {{base}}/incidents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### RF-09 · Confirmar anafilaxia -> orden de paro (reemplaza el id)
POST {{base}}/incidents/INC-xxxxxxxx/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### RF-10 · Reporte de incidente (reemplaza el id)
GET {{base}}/incidents/INC-xxxxxxxx/report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### RNF-01 / RNF-05 · Métricas
GET {{base}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Auditoría
GET {{base}}/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
